0 -14 Td
/F2 9 Tf
(  * ngalei \(Ukhrul\) : earth, ground) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 8 Tf
(    Analysis: PTk *C-lay cognate with Proto-Kuki-Chin *lay.) Tj
0 -12 Td
/F2 9 Tf
(  * shing \(Ukhrul\) : wood, tree) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 8 Tf
(    Analysis: PTk *sing cognate with Written Burmese sac and Tibetan shing.) Tj
0 -12 Td
